{
  "key_path": "AiServicesManagementDescription",
  "content": "Turn AI features on or off across {{productName}} and {{organizationName}} editors. When disabled, the {{aiSettings}} section is hidden, {{aiAgents}} become unavailable to all users, and paid {{organizationName}} {{aiServices}} can no longer be accessed. Your interaction history is kept safe and fully restored if you turn {{aiServices}} back on.",
  "content_en_sha1_hash": "97773202e49eccec23f8efbb00eb50f5c2542cf5",
